scaping combat for 4 turns. While under this effect you gain %d%% increased resistance to all damage, %0.1f increased stamina regeneration, immunity to stun, pin, daze and slowing effects and %d%% increased movement speed. \nAny action other than movement will cancel this effect.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你专注逃跑 4 回合。处于此状态时增加 %d%% 所有伤害抗性，%0.1f 体力恢复，免疫震慑，定身，眩晕和减速效果并增加 %d%% 移动速度。\n除移动外的任何行动将终止该效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bf2d0ea2f2d57472a2dbcde4cde2505f9144163e7040f018c29f5f4f5bd189dc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"831ee1a50831dc00b055a36fafc5647a99ab752e3688cb1074dd2e835ffc1fe5","logical_entry_identity":"cba05c89ea70695d096436151135a8d5ed93d49636370be108c3e1c9440dc698","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Malevolent Dimensional Jelly","source_tag":"entity name","target":"恶毒次元果冻怪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ac5fb40a4180781d077e14a2a441c4b4525cbf28fb31df8a9885a809a8e40a04","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"831f05d58ec63cc8870fa30dde68954945e40429e8d235fd7597e706ce2065f0","logical_entry_identity":"a4b74558323f995d69014b68df2471d94af3d92871e03fc15a84f812448285c2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Birth Options","source_tag":"_t","target":"角色创建设置"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3c189db4ea925d7a9787907217cc9e5a9b7f5f3af33784dffec955e8c37f1da8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"831fe0f43a3332036e5bc52ce370daa8c4071d506943e5097f4157ce846b35b6","logical_entry_identity":"e6146488f5184dafeab97a2358759553c49b2763738689ff8774a73e52dc81fe","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Creates a shadowy copy of a hostile target. The copy will attack its progenitor immediately and lasts for %d turns.\n\t\tThe duplicate has %d%% of the target's life, +50%% darkness resistance, -50%% light resistance, and deals 50%% less damage.\n\t\tThe duration and life scale with your Cunning.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"创造一个敌对目标的阴影复制体。复制体会立即攻击其本体，并持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t复制体拥有目标 %d%% 的生命值、+50%% 暗影抗性和 -50%% 光系抗性，造成的伤害降低 50%%。\n\t\t持续时间和生命值随你的灵巧属性提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3ad426a9131f4403482fcecbb815117122739eacfc198463e45fdcb637b94c71","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83257240f03f3c22bf88c1741d731a0c85e42ac5291637cb7c31ca3ccb484fad","logical_entry_identity":"03578ef36a6cd376a79e12a9f5d0ef407ad21ea81c39121f9c772ab80ed93658","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 Strength, +1 Dexterity, +0 Constitution","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +4 力量，+1 敏捷，+0 体质"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"db55f2253fc860917ff979ef04a349ef051d0952509ae157832df53c9fae22f9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8327ad294fb89f4e48a37f0a8fa11f24e854833351abeadef5dfa03280b79c74","logical_entry_identity":"d272a89063e1a583fc957fbbcc3529eef8bafd2a2308e49e8a78c1e5e951728b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.","source_tag":"_t","target":"使用裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8ff5a3b9d66e95df1c6d2f03b660f8b9e7d778e4fe3b4b83b831a4e920f949ee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"832dc7b80340e681a53311d758765f2c7b2e2062b217aa7eb1e5abfa15c75c13","logical_entry_identity":"f0d86c1f7179b10e807f944c112f051485268e8b3d801e7c3a10994675d007ce","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Willpower","source_tag":"stat name","target":"意志"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"62171a3bee8c772ad58b849ad6c4737480c1f4ea06da7ab8d4162db6809707a9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"833415830b402c175440b032d63ef033f82cd293569b745f5ed8388a31993913","logical_entry_identity":"fe22f97523c97bea2f29b5837d5473137c6b12690e2a553584ba63d9f41e7898","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Game? I like playing, what's this about?","source_tag":"_t","target":"游戏？我喜欢玩，怎么个玩法？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"26c330ae05d86f046889fd6700fddc9bffd0a08e811c6e657ce4db0fec9128d9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83371559dbc76ac06a181aaef5ab7a22ae9fb6d748a4f5af614