 size category above #{italic}#big#{normal}#; further, all damage procs from your weapons are reduced by 50%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"食人魔的身体对法术和刻印的亲和力很强。\n\t\t增加 %d 法术豁免，增加刻印的属性加成效果 %d%%。\n\t\t技能等级 5 时，你的身体变得如此强壮，能在主手持有双手武器的同时，副手持有其他副手武器。\n\t\t这样做的话，你的命中、物理、法术、精神强度会下降 20%%，体型超过#{italic}#“较大”#{normal}#时，每增加一体型，惩罚减少 5%%。同时你的武器附加伤害减少 50%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b2b00e69b634aa2bda641e3360221a9e1d7d45a67157229d57c1cb830ef8569c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"836ac0ee75f7dd6d1f42ced3f5df3865a600ffff6c2b904c53f86e91a9711feb","logical_entry_identity":"25355104441f4dd74cb8f0ef6944b081ed4cfb6a12175ae03be0984130606ad1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This mask appears to be carved out of the skull of a creature that never should have existed, malformed and distorted. You shiver as you look upon it, and its hollow eye sockets seem to stare back into you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这件面具似乎用某种不明生物的头骨制成的，那是一种本不应该存在于世间的可怕生物，畸形并且扭曲。每当你盯着这个面具时，它那空洞的眼窝似乎也在注视着你，令你感到发自内心的颤栗。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8e0cb6b28017d15a5d5bdbc894d776f706843b2d815f6e3c8053da6837f2002e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"836b54cc843c76aa376560789556ef3e7cc1d694b7ee8277d4fe39a3cd401fa3","logical_entry_identity":"8a4785052dd5e5f1c74c498f5fd306d2d392415b379aad5b3bb5761dd0ffa271","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Cleansing Flames","source_tag":"_t","target":"净化之焰"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f36bba020f2d8cb52929ac936c9d958b240b85ff2ab9865361363382de686d33","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83766ae53cc8ddeb6364040edb8c3b8a15026ea34082ffc2cd145c7073e16360","logical_entry_identity":"844e01c5c26c46f45d77a1a15d8c448086e0dd8fc2fa3c35145f582dcb2e6679","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Tatoos 6","source_tag":"_t","target":"纹身6"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8286e07607823a68a2a54cafecdf26cf010ee690fd5127eea061c7a262f47ed3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"83790f6cef5c833486b8f8e968f418f4d3b9